Package: pve-sensors
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Cristopfer Luis <ocristopfer@gmail.com>
Depends: pve-manager, perl, lm-sensors, librrds-perl, systemd
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/ocristopfer/proxmox-sensors
Description: CPU/GPU/NVMe/HDD temperatures in the Proxmox VE node Summary
 Adds a "Temperatures" line to the node Summary and a history chart next to
 the CPU/Network/RAM ones. The patches are re-applied automatically when a
 pve-manager upgrade removes them.
